    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BURROWS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Burrows</strong> is an open-world action-adventure game where you play as <i>Thumper</i>, a rabbit on a path of revenge. Armed with a massive, upgradeable slingshot, you'll face off against a wide variety of enemies in both ranged and melee combat. Precision, timing, and strategy are key\u2014every fight is a challenge, and every victory is earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a interconnected world filled with hostile creatures. Discover and unlock new slingshot types with unique stats and special abilities, and collect powerful armor sets to customize your playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burrows is inspired by Souls-like gameplay\u2014expect punishing bosses, unforgiving environments, and a story told through exploration and atmosphere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you venture out of your burrow?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BURROWS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Burrows</strong> is an open-world action-adventure game where you play as <i>Thumper</i>, a rabbit on a path of revenge. Armed with a massive, upgradeable slingshot, you'll face off against a wide variety of enemies in both ranged and melee combat. Precision, timing, and strategy are key\u2014every fight is a challenge, and every victory is earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a interconnected world filled with hostile creatures. Discover and unlock new slingshot types with unique stats and special abilities, and collect powerful armor sets to customize your playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burrows is inspired by Souls-like gameplay\u2014expect punishing bosses, unforgiving environments, and a story told through exploration and atmosphere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you venture out of your burrow?</p>",
    "short_description": "Burrows is a third-person open-world action RPG with Souls-like combat. Play as a rabbit using a slingshot to battle deadly foes. Explore an open world, collect armor and unique slingshots, and take revenge on predators in a fantasy adventure.",
